<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Interview Overview Submitted to HR</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #007bff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            color: #dc3545;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .content {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;
        }
        .info-item {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #495057;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #dc3545;
        }
        .candidate-info {
            background-color: #e3f2fd;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
        }
        .conversation-preview {
            background-color: #e9ecef;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            max-height: 300px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .conversation-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .user-message {
            border-left: 3px solid #007bff;
        }
        .assistant-message {
            border-left: 3px solid #28a745;
        }
        .message-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .user-label {
            color: #007bff;
        }
        .assistant-label {
            color: #28a745;
        }
        .cta-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #dc3545;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            background-color: #c82333;
        }
        .secondary-button {
            background-color: #6c757d;
        }
        .secondary-button:hover {
            background-color: #545b62;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .footer-links a {
            color: #007bff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 10px;
        }
        .hr-icon {
            font-size: 48px;
            color: #dc3545;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .priority-badge {
            background-color: #ffc107;
            color: #212529;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">CollabAI</div>
            <div class="hr-icon">👥</div>
            <h1 class="title">New Interview Overview Submitted</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">A candidate has submitted their interview overview for HR review</p>
            <div class="priority-badge">⚡ Requires HR Review</div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">Dear HR Team,</p>
            
            <p>A new interview overview has been submitted and is ready for your review. Please find the candidate details and interview summary below:</p>

            <div class="candidate-info">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #2196f3;">👤 Candidate Information</h3>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Candidate Name:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.name}}</span> 
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Email:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.email}}</span>
                </div> 
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Applied Position:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.content.appliedPosition}}</span>
                </div> 
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #dc3545;">📋 Interview Details</h3>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Interview ID:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.thread_id}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Summary:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.content.summary}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Expertise:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.content.expertise}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Marks:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.content.marks}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Recommendable:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.content.recommendable}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Total Q&A Exchanges:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.totalMessages}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <span class="info-label">Submission Date:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{emailData.submissionDate}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            {{#if conversationPreview}}
            <h3>📝 Interview Preview:</h3>
            <div class="conversation-preview">
                {{#each conversationPreview}}
                <div class="conversation-item user-message">
                    <div class="message-label user-label">Candidate:</div>
                    <div>{{this.userPrompt}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="conversation-item assistant-message">
                    <div class="message-label assistant-label">AI Interviewer:</div>
                    <div>{{this.systemPrompt}}</div>
                </div>
                {{/each}}
                {{#if hasMore}}
                <p style="text-align: center; color: #6c757d; font-style: italic;">... and {{remainingCount}} more exchanges</p>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Review the complete interview transcript</li>
                <li>Evaluate candidate responses</li>
                <li>Schedule follow-up if needed</li>
                <li>Update candidate account status in the system</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>HR Department - CollabAI</strong></p>
            <p>This interview overview requires your attention and review.</p>
            
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="{{hrDashboardUrl}}">HR Dashboard</a>
                <a href="{{candidateProfileUrl}}">Candidate Profile</a>
                <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Support</a>
            </div>
            
            <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
                © {{currentYear}} CollabAI. All rights reserved.<br>
                This notification was sent to the HR team for interview review.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 